Package: mongolstats
Type: Package
Title: Tidy Access to Mongolian Official Statistics and Metadata
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R:
    c(person(given = "Temuulen",
             family = "Enebish",
             role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
             email = "temuulen@gmail.com"),
      person("National Statistics Office of Mongolia",
             role = "cph",
             comment = "Bundled statistical extracts; see inst/COPYRIGHTS"))
Description: A 'tidyverse'-friendly client for the public statistical services of
    the National Statistics Office of Mongolia <https://data.1212.mn/>. Discover
    tables and their dimensions, and fetch statistical data as 'tibble' data frames with
    English or Mongolian labels. Periods are reported by their labels and
    can be selected in any of the office's period formats, tables that have
    moved within the catalogue are found automatically, and large requests
    are split to stay within the server's limits. Source provenance and raw
    observation symbols support reproducible exports. Experimental clients
    provide access to the public data and metadata portals, including official
    definitions, collection forms, classifications, and reviewed indicator
    queries. Maps and joins by
    statistical code are provided by the companion package 'mongolmaps'.
